    {
      "index": 1,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Act 4: \"A Posteriori\"",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Second-Class Cabin",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ashby",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This rouge was used in the manifesto. I found it in Yamada's bag.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada is the culprit.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Who killed Black and Voysey?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Who killed Charlie? I could ask you that, Captain.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I found the rouge from the second manifesto. Compare them and see.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So there is an accomplice.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Rage all you like.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ilyusha Grancelius. The second rouge was in her room.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...you goddamn bastards...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Locke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "C-C-Captaaaain!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Calm down, idiot!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A-a bomb! We found a bomb in the keel section!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Good timing. Wonderful.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "One hour until the scheduled time!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "An amateur cannot disarm it. We need the culprit's help.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Locke. Arrest Kasuke and Ilyusha. Confine them with the bomb.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Foolish captain. Better insight might have saved the ship. You failed to read my mind.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No. Disarm it now. There is no time for questions.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Keep making a fuss and I won't mind shooting one of you! Get moving!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Aye, aye, sir!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Bilge",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yamada Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Idiots! Ashby and Dunant tricked you! He is the culprit!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ilyu",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We lost because of one stick of rouge.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Damn it! I will make them regret this!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke, that...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Depths",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A light rain falls upon my sleeves. Let it all be...happy, happy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What is that?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Just a popular song...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ilyusha, you are beautiful.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cargo Hold",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kirikov",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It is a long voyage, is it not?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A Japanese whaler should find us in the South Atlantic...but food will last for only two.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I suppose so.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Please be patient.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "His work is done.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I do not like it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then what is it?! Stop, Kirikov! Put the gun away!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Detective or not, he is still an amateur. How naive.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Good shooting.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What will we do with the bodies?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sink them with the ship. They cannot disarm the bomb.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Good. Let us go.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sink the ship and Ashby's plan dies with it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "She is not the winner.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Think so?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sorry, Kasuke. Without me, this would not have happened...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We saw good things too.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You are a strange man.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Let us begin.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    }
  ]
}
